<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT SIGNS $4.5 MLN SINGAPORE DEALS.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT SIGNS $4.5 MLN SINGAPORE DEALS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader Stalexport SA signed two steel exports contracts to Singapore, worth total $4.5 million, Stalexport said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the deliveries were scheduled for the first two months of this year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
